<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Student Association on YC Photography</title><link>https://blog.imych.one/categories/student-association/</link><description>Recent content in Student Association on YC Photography</description><image><url>https://blog.imych.one/images/banner.webp</url><link>https://blog.imych.one/images/banner.webp</link></image><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 03 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.imych.one/categories/student-association/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>工作性質，生活模式</title><link>https://blog.imych.one/working-and-lifestyle/</link><pubDate>Fri, 08 Mar 2024 11:50:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.imych.one/working-and-lifestyle/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;不同工作性質的人，有不同的生活模式。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>學生會鬼故事：期中限定！宿舍表單槓到宿委會篇</title><link>https://blog.imych.one/student-association-dormitory-form-vs-student-dorm-committee/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Nov 2023 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.imych.one/student-association-dormitory-form-vs-student-dorm-committee/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;tl;dr: 學權部近期關心學生住宿議題，製作調查表單邀請大家填寫。表單發布後的兩個小時內，宿委會即發布一篇針對學生會表單一貼文進行聲明。這將會是鬼故事系列的起頭，讓我們繼續看下去 👀&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>對學生會的殘存印象</title><link>https://blog.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Jul 2021 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;剛剛，我們家副會長轉傳了下一屆美宣的詢問給我：「限動上手捧燈泡的圖檔是否還在？我們覺得這個設計還不錯，感覺可以沿用，但我們想要改個色彩。」&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="手捧著燈泡的圖" data-cf-image="true" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 768px) min(720px, calc(100vw - 28px)), 720px" src="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled.png" srcset="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=640,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled.png 640w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=960,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled.png 960w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1280,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled.png 1280w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled.png 1920w"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;手捧著燈泡的圖&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我從擔任起學生會的幹部後，一向注重檔案管理術的我，不加思索地在雲端上將一次次活動、事件、類型的資料分門別類用資料夾包著，未來在找檔案時似乎也較好檢索。在收到這樣子的要求時，檔案分類引以為傲的我偷偷笑了起來，只不過當一個一個資料夾翻過後，我似乎才發現當初這張圖只是我隨手做得而已，「手捧燈泡的圖」也只是我從素材網站上拿了張看得順眼的圖來用罷了。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="手捧燈泡的圖比比皆是" data-cf-image="true" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 768px) min(720px, calc(100vw - 28px)), 720px" src="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%201.png" srcset="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=640,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%201.png 640w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=960,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%201.png 960w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1280,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%201.png 1280w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%201.png 1920w"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;手捧燈泡的圖比比皆是&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;不過在穿梭於眾多資料夾間，才慢慢意識到被我搬到封存區，名為「#SMSU10th」的資料夾，竟不知不覺中紀錄了就職這一年來的一次次活動。勤奮紀錄的我，這些在雲端上所站的空間也渾然漸增，一年稍縱即逝。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="雲端空間在哭哭"&gt;雲端空間在哭哭。&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;其實不得不說，在剛剛藉由找素材的機會也翻過了其他的資料夾，當時上幹時的紀錄片段、嘗試處理學權卻導致跟學校硬碰硬的文件與紀錄、一次次的活動企劃書與照片、帶著學生會頭銜參與外部研討會的發想……在現在看來，也不得感嘆如果沒有當時勤奮的「紀錄」，至今我對這個熱血的我還能有多少印象呢？&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="雲端資料夾" data-cf-image="true" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 768px) min(720px, calc(100vw - 28px)), 720px" src="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%202.png" srcset="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=640,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%202.png 640w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=960,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%202.png 960w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1280,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%202.png 1280w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%202.png 1920w"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;雲端資料夾&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="無頭蒼蠅帶我亂飛"&gt;無頭蒼蠅帶我亂飛。&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;最令我印象深刻的即是「學權」。學權其實可大可小，在剛剛 review 資料索引後，才驚覺學生會在我們學校雖然小小的沒什麼用，乍看下似乎只有辦活動的料，但在這學權的敏感領域下卻又能因為抱持不同意見而影響群眾（行政、老師、同學、學生會的夥伴），幸運一點甚至還能戳爆學校不為人知的秘密。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;其實不單是敝校，其他學校的學生會也曾因學校不採納訴求下發動靜坐所造成的盛大場面(?)。看似平常都要聽學校指示的學生會，在認真起來也是很有威力的RRRRR！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="某校學生會因學校不採納訴求下發動靜坐所造成的盛大場面，該校學生 Dabo 同學授權提供" data-cf-image="true" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 768px) min(720px, calc(100vw - 28px)), 720px" src="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%203.png" srcset="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=640,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%203.png 640w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=960,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%203.png 960w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1280,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%203.png 1280w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/smsu10th-retire/Untitled%203.png 1920w"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>109年度全國高級中等學校學生自治及參與之培力研習營</title><link>https://blog.imych.one/2020-student-autonomy-training-camp/</link><pubDate>Tue, 26 Jan 2021 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.imych.one/2020-student-autonomy-training-camp/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="大概在去年 7 月，因緣際會下參加了由國教署主辦的 高級中學學生自治培力營 ，最後在報名截止前一小時才搭上這班培力列車。" data-cf-image="true" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 768px) min(720px, calc(100vw - 28px)), 720px" src="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto/https://img.imych.one/2020-student-autonomy-training-camp/0_0KCw56PksJ8aHM1G.webp" srcset="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=640,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/2020-student-autonomy-training-camp/0_0KCw56PksJ8aHM1G.webp 640w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=960,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/2020-student-autonomy-training-camp/0_0KCw56PksJ8aHM1G.webp 960w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1280,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/2020-student-autonomy-training-camp/0_0KCw56PksJ8aHM1G.webp 1280w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/2020-student-autonomy-training-camp/0_0KCw56PksJ8aHM1G.webp 1920w"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;大概在去年 7 月，因緣際會下參加了由國教署主辦的 
&lt;a
href = "https://sites.google.com/a/chsc.tw/109sapc/plan/wubiaotidewenzhang"
target = "_blank"
rel = "nofollow noopener noreferrer"
&gt;
&lt;span&gt;
高級中學學生自治培力營
